  "slug": "turn-navigator",
  "name": "Turn Navigator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Jump between conversation turns in tmux using Shift+Up/Down.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `help` (Show turn navigator keybindings)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install turn-navigator@claude-community` from `zaxliu/turn-navigator`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that lets you jump between conversation turns in tmux using keyboard shortcuts.",
